@startuml
!theme plain

actor "Project Manager" as PM

boundary "Antarmuka Proyek" as ProjectUI
control "Kontrol Proyek" as ProjectControl
entity "Entitas Proyek" as ProjectEntity
database "Basis Data Proyek" as ProjectDB

PM -[#blue]> ProjectUI: 1. Login & Pilih Proyek

ProjectUI -[#green]> ProjectControl: 2. Meminta Data Proyek
ProjectControl -[#purple]> ProjectEntity: 3. Memuat Data Proyek
ProjectEntity -[#purple]> ProjectDB: 4. Mengambil Data Proyek dari DB
ProjectDB -[#purple]-> ProjectEntity: 5. Mengembalikan Data Proyek
ProjectEntity -[#purple]-> ProjectControl: 6. Mengirim Data Proyek
ProjectControl -[#green]-> ProjectUI: 7. Mengirim Detail Proyek

ProjectUI -[#darkgreen]-> PM: 8. Menampilkan Detail Proyek

PM -[#orange]> ProjectUI: 9. Tambah/Edit/Hapus Proyek (Aksi)
ProjectUI -[#red]> ProjectControl: 10. Mengirim Data Perubahan (Proyek)

ProjectControl -[#brown]> ProjectEntity: 11. Memproses Perubahan (Tambah/Edit/Hapus)
ProjectEntity -[#brown]> ProjectDB: 12. Simpan/Update/Hapus Data Proyek di DB
ProjectDB -[#brown]-> ProjectEntity: 13. Konfirmasi Operasi
ProjectEntity -[#brown]-> ProjectControl: 14. Mengirim Konfirmasi Berhasil

ProjectControl -[#blue]-> ProjectUI: 15. Mengirim Status Sukses
ProjectUI -[#blue]-> PM: 16. Menampilkan Status Sukses (Operasi Berhasil)

@enduml
